               <msContents>
                  <msItem n="1">
                     <title key="work_3385">Hebrew Bible: Prophets (Minor Prophets and
                        Ezekiel)</title>
                     <title xml:lang="he" key="work_3385">נביאים (תרי עשר ויחזקאל)</title>
                     <title xml:lang="he-Latn-x-lc" key="work_3385">Neviʾim (trei asar
                        ve-Yeḥezḳel)</title>
                     <note>Both the beginning and the end are defective; Hosea begins halfway
                        through 10:12, and Ezekiel ends halfway through 42:13.</note>
                     <note>There are several lacunae in the text: Amos 2:12-5:16 (before <locus>f.
                           18</locus>); Ezekiel 15:4-16:13 (after <locus>f. 148</locus>) and
                        16:47-21:6 (after <locus>f. 152</locus>).</note>
                     <note>Several folios have been misbound. <locus>Ff. 9 and 86</locus> (in this
                        order, together with several other folios which have been lost) should
                        follow <locus>f. 17</locus>.</note>
                     <note>All the discontinuities in the text have been noted in Latin by a
                        late-seventeenth-century hand, probably that of <persName key="person_131"
                           >Robert Huntington</persName> himself. The same hand also numbered the
                        chapters and verses (by increments of 5).</note>
                     <textLang mainLang="he">Hebrew</textLang>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
               <physDesc>
