                        <condition><locus>Ff. 208-9</locus> have been injured (with some loss of
                           text) and subsequently repaired. Some of the text on <locus>ff. 156v,
                              157r</locus> (Ezekiel 21:35-37, 22:2-4) have been deliberated blotted
                           out with dark brown ink.</condition>
                     </supportDesc>
