                  </handDesc>
                  <bindingDesc>
                     <p>Smooth golden-brown leather over pasteboards, with blind-tooled decoration
                        along the turn-ins and the outer edges of the boards. A summary of the
                        content (‘PROPHETAE MINORES: HEBR.’) and the current shelfmark are
                        gold-tooled on the spine. The number '604' has also been written in ink on
                        the fore-edge.</p>
                  </bindingDesc>
